window.products.push({"id":160051,"name":"2 Pack 1043 Humidifier Wick Filter Replacement for Essick Air AIRCARE EP9500, EP9700, EP9800, EP9R500, EP9R800, 821000, 826000, 826800, 831000 and Bem","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pzCNDWeLL._AC_SL1405_.jpg","description":"【WIDE APPLICATION】- Compatible with Essick Air AIRCARE Humidifiers Model EP9500, EP9700, EP9800, EP9R500, EP9R700, EP9R800, 821000, 821001, 826000, 826800, 831000, 836000HB, SS390DWHT. Compatible with Bemis Space Saver 800 8000 Evaporative series air humidifier. 【PREMIUM QUALITY】- Our upgraded 1043 super humidifier wick filter with the hot glue strips and dense construction is made from high-quality reinforced mesh paper and adopts advanced lower density structure technology verified by the manufacturer, better than the original, with higher efficiency, less pressure and the best quality to have the most surface area to displace moisture back into air as you expect . 【REPLACEMENT RECYCLE & EASY INSTALLATION】- Our 1043 humidifier filters fill humidifier tank with distilled water. We recommend you to replace the filter every 2-3 months for optimal performance (depending upon your usage). It is fairly easy to install the 1043 humidifier filter, no tools required, just cost you few minutes. Simply run the humidifier out of water. Remove the top, there is a frame you need to remove. Remove the old wick, replace with new, put the frame on the wick. 【EXCELLENT ABSORPTION & MAXIMUM OUTPUT】- Our 1043 humidifier wick filter does a very good job of filtering out the hardness minerals in the water and prevents a white powder from entering the room air and depositing on everything in sight. Besides, it really helps make the air moist and breathable in winter. We aim to create a healthy and comfortable environment for those who want to breathe fresh air and meet the demand of your daily life. The right choice for you. 【SHOP with CONFIDENCE】- provide all customers with a simple, streamlined shopping experience of large appliance replacement parts, and prove that we have the highest quality parts and service out there.If you have any quality problem, please contact LOTVOSA customer service team in time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pzCNDWeLL._AC_SL1405_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOTVOSA","source_asin":"B0BWTYRJY1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-160051","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWTYRJY1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWTYRJY1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
