window.products.push({"id":160077,"name":"Kegco Full-Size Digital Homebrew Kegerator 2 Tap with Cornelius Ball Lock Keg - Black Stainless","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eHnSouoBL._AC_SL1225_.jpg","description":"STYLISH DESIGN: Brilliantly designed for home brewers with 2 Tap equipment and a Cornelius Ball Lock Keg. It is built with a black stainless steel door that resist smudges and fingerprints more than standard stainless steel while cleaning is easily done with a damp towel follow by a soft cloth. It features a removable drip tray, a chrome safety rail, and easy-roll locking casters. The UL listed unit measures 33.25\" H x 24\" W x 25\" D. DIGITAL TEMPERATURE CONTROL: Added digital functionality to your liking, you can easily set and adjust the internal temperature by one degree. Easy to see with the blue LED display and the temperature change be changed to Fahrenheit or Celsius. Activate the Deep Chill function to cool your warm keg quicker. WIDE ENOUGH TEMPERATURE RANGE TO DISPENSE OR FERMENT: Kegco's HBK309 home brew kegerators utilize fan-forced cooling to provide even, consistent cooling throughout the unit. They boast one of the coldest temperature ranges of any beer keg dispenser on the market today, and can be set as low as 32 degrees. This kegerator has a wide enough temperature range to allow you to ferment your brew in a precisely controlled environment, ensuring consistent results time after time. LARGE INTERIOR: The HBK309X can dispense one 5 gallon ball lock homebrew keg while simultaneously storing up to two more at their ideal temperature! This kegerator's spacious interior can hold up to three Cornelius kegs at a time. If you'll be using it as a fermentation chamber, it will be able to hold a 6 gallon bucket or carboy. PLEASE NOTE: This is a homebrew kegerator and includes ball lock keg couplers for home brew kegs; it will not tap commercial D system kegs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eHnSouoBL._AC_SL1225_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kegco","source_asin":"B07CBM7JMY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-160077","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CBM7JMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CBM7JMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
