window.products.push({"id":160107,"name":"DG94-00520A Gas Range Oven Igniter Fit for Samsung NX58H5600SS NX58H5650WS Range Oven, Exact Replacement Igniter Replace WB13K21 Norton 501a Fit for G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H5dnFsH1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FREE REPLACEMENT: Please note that there are fragile objects inside the igniter. If they get damaged during transportation, please contact us for a refund or replacement. ⚠⚠⚠The SIC material is very special and has a high incidence of production line defects, so it must undergo aging tests during production. Therefore, you may notice discoloration after receiving the product. Please do not worry, as this does not affect use. PERFECT REPLACE: DG94-00520A gas range oven igniter is perfectly replaces WB13K21, Norton 501a, W10918546, W11176454, 5304509706, DG94-01441a, 316489402, 2692271 (The difference of replacement parts is only reflected in the installation, If you find that the connection port does not match, please cut off the connection line and connect it to the device with a nut.) COMPATIBLE MODELS: Our Gas range oven igniter compatible with Samsung Whirlpool GE Crosley Kenmore Hotpoint etc. Popular models: NX58H5600SS/AA, NX58K3310SS, FX710BGS/XAA (For more models, please refer to the description on our detail page) EXCELLENT PERFORMANCE: The DG94-00520A oven igniter for samsung is used to light the oven burner and adjust the temperature normally. It fixes the symptom that the oven failing to heat or not heat properly. Use this high-quality replacement part to extend the life of the oven PREMIUM QUALITY & EASY INSTALLATION: Our DG94-00520A samsung oven igniter replacement is made of durable and high-quality materials well-tested by the manufacturer, with higher heat resistence, durability and the best quality for greater power connection, higher load and longer service life. ⚠️It is fairly easy to install. If wire connector does not match up you will need to cut off the connector and splice the wires with porcelain wire nuts","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H5dnFsH1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Funmit","source_asin":"B0CGWPBF6Q","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-160107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CGWPBF6Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0CGWPBF6Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
