window.products.push({"id":160254,"name":"80040 Pack of 12 Washer Agitator Dogs Premium Replacement Part by Canamax - Compatible with Kenmore & Whirlpool Washers - Replaces 285612 285770 33668","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Dhp+hmsAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE REPLACEMENT PART YOU NEED FOR YOUR WASHER Functions Agitator directional cogs, otherwise known as dog ears, come in a package of four and are generally found in washers where the motor is connected directly to the washer. The agitator is what creates the thrusting motion in your washer. If you have noticed that your washer is not draining properly, is making unfamiliar noises, shakes, or is simply not washing properly, it could be due to faulty agitator directional cogs. They can be found by simply removing the softener dispenser and then removing the agitator cap. For this repair, you will need a 1/4 or a 3/8ths socket set, and needle nose pliers. Wide compatibility The perfect fit for most top washer brands: Whirlpool, Kenmore, KitchenAid, Roper, Estate, Inglis, Crosley & Maytag Replaces Part numbers: 3366877, 387091, LP338, AH388034, EA388034, PS388034, 80040, 80040VP, 285612, 285770, AP3119063, ER80040, SB80040, 3109, TJ90LP338, 99989668 Solve your following problems Pumps but will not spin Will not agitate Spins slowly Noisy Ideal replacements This part has been designed carefully and well-tested by the manufacturer to make sure it will work properly with your washer as the original part. Search no further!! Click Add to Cart to get this replacement and have your washer back to work soon. The Whirlpool brand names and logos are the registered trademarks of their respective owners. Any use of the Whirlpool brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Dhp+hmsAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Canamax","source_asin":"B07TF8KS9X","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-160254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TF8KS9X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TF8KS9X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
