window.products.push({"id":160280,"name":"Air King ESDQ1248 Energy Star Qualified 24-Inch Under Cabinet Range Hood with 2-Speed Blower and 270-CFM, Stainless Steel Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31lCVaOZHxL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Air King ESDQ1248 Energy Star 24-Inch Under Cabinet Range Hood lets your hood be noticed for the stylized attractive appearance, not the sound it makes. This Energy Star rated hood will save you money by significantly reducing energy consumption. The 24-inch wide hood comes in a black finish and features a quiet running, fully enclosed motor with 270-CFM of ventilation at 4-sones on high speed (a sound level is similar to that of a running refrigerator) and 150-CFM at 1.5-sones on low speed, along with electronically balanced twin centrifugal blowers. The hood includes a 26-watt GU24 high efficacy fluorescent cook top light with (2) brightness settings, 4-watt nightlight (bulb not included) and 2-speed control switch. The ESDQ1246 can accommodate convertible ducting of 3.25-inches by 10-inches horizontally, vertically or ductless with the included duct adapter and damper. Also included with this range hood is an easy-to-remove grease filter to trap grease and other debris to keep your range hood clean. Air King range hoods are HVI2100 certified for both air movement and sound giving you the assurance that the product will perform as promised. The hood has a streamline body that measures 24-inches wide by 7.5-inches high by 18.5-inches deep and 24-gauge steel construction. The mitered front allows cabinets on both sides of the hood to open fully. Please note that the ductless configuration does not meet Energy Star qualifications and requires CF-01 Charcoal Oder Filters that are not included. The Air King ESDQ1248 Energy Star 24-Inch Under Cabinet Range Hood comes with a 5-year limited warranty. Comes with the necessary mounting screws and instruction sheets for an easy installation process. From the Manufacturer The Air King ESDQ1248 Under Cabinet 24-Inch Range Hood is an efficient, Energy Star qualified solution for under cabinet kitchen ventilation. This range hood features an electronically balanced twin centrifugal blower with a 2-speed control switch. At an operating speed of 150-CFM (cubic feet per minute) at 1.5-Sones and 41.0-watts, the sound level is similar to that of a running refrigerator, while still providing enough ventilation required for typical cooking. When you need added ventilation, the medium speed setting of 200-CFM and the high speed setting at 270-CFM (4.0-Sones) can handle the task. Included with this range hood is an easy-to-remove grease filter to trap grease and other debris to keep your range hood clean. The ESDQ1248 features added lighting with the 26-watt, 4-pin high efficiency fluorescent lamp that is California Title 24 Residential Lighting Standard compliant, as well as the option for a 4-watt nightlight (bulb not included). This unit allows for convertible ducting with the included duct adapter and damper. Choose between vertical and horizontal ducting measuring 3-1/4-inches by 10-inches or ductless operation with the removable front vent. Vertical performance provides 270-CFM at 4.0-Sones for the high speed setting and 150-CFM at 1.5-Sones and 41.3-watts on the low speed setting. The ductless configuration does not meet Energy Star qualifications and requires CF-01 Charcoal Oder Filters that are not included. The ESDQ1248 measures 24-inches wide by 7-1/2-inches high by 18-1/2-inches in depth, has a 24-gauge stainless steel finish and comes with all of the necessary mounting screws and instruction sheets for an installation. The Air King ESDQ1248 Energy Star Under Cabinet Range Hood comes with a 5-year limited warranty. Air King offers a full line of industrial grade and commercial grade air circulating fan solutions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31lCVaOZHxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Air King","source_asin":"B07XM6SDQP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-160280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XM6SDQP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XM6SDQP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
