window.products.push({"id":160282,"name":"ZAFRO Commercial Ice Maker, 100lbs/24H Ice Machine with 33lbs Ice Bin, Self-Cleaning Under Counter Stainless Steel Freestanding Ice Maker for Restaura","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":455.06,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IV2UazvdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multi Function Control Panel】 Commercial ice machines are equipped with smart LCD panels. Any function can be solved in the ice maker control panel: 1-24 hours timing, full ice reminder, water shortage reminder, self-cleaning function, just press the (+) or (-) button to adjust the ice making time, so as to adjust the size of the ice cubes to meet different needs. 【Fast & Efficient】 Commercial ice machines are equipped with powerful compressors that cycle every 12-18 mins and can make 48 ice cubes and 100 pounds of ice in 24 hours. Ice maker is a low-noise, high-efficiency and energy-efficient professional machine capable of making ice quickly, making it the wonderful choice for commercial use. 【Widely Used】Ice machine compact design of the allows you to install Freestanding ice machine anywhere. freestanding or under counter. Just make sure there's a water outlet near the ice machine and you can use it in places like at home/kitchen/restaurant/bar/hotel/café. 【Large Storage Capacity】Large professional commercial ice machine have ice storage bin capacity of 33 pounds; A thick insulation layer extends the storage time of the ice cubes, and the complimentary ice spoon can help break the ice cubes and remove them conveniently. (Note: If you do not use the ice immediately, transfer the ice cubes to the refrigerator) 【Durable & Deluxe】Ice machine is made of stainless steel, which not only has a luxurious and beautiful appearance, also improves the durability, robustness and service life of the ice machine. Ice scoop, water inlet pipe and drain hose, everything you need is provided after careful consideration. ZAFRO ice maker is your ideal choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IV2UazvdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZAFRO","source_asin":"B0BQMCG233","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-160282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQMCG233","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQMCG233","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
