window.products.push({"id":160304,"name":"Aqua Fresh WF293 Refrigerator Water Filter Replacement Compatible with 4396701 Replacement for 9915, EDR6D1, RWF2000A, LC200V, RWF1021, Filter 6, WFL2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zpgIm3dHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Aqua Fresh WF293 Replacement for 4396701 / FILTER 6 Refrigerator Water Filter Replacement Water Filter for following Refrigerator Models: Replacement Water Filter for following Refrigerator Models: 4396701, 4396702, 4396703, 4396706, FILTER 6, EDR6D1, EDR6D2, EDR6D3 4396701, 4396702, 4396703, 4396706, FILTER 6, EDR6D1, EDR6D2, EDR6D3 9915 , 46-9915, 9915P, 469915, 4609915000 9915 , 46-9915, 9915P, 469915, 4609915000 Description : The Aqua Fresh WF293 Replacement Water Filter for 4396701 is designed to keep your water fresh, tasty and contaminant free. It is a low-cost alternative to other big brands matching their performance. The filter fits many established brands of refrigerator models like Whirlpool and enhances your refrigerator performance.The filter is quite a high-quality purifier, filtering out harmful contaminants from raw tap water. It effortlessly removes harmful chemicals like chlorine from water keeping water healthy. It also removes undesired taste and smell along with dirt particles thus making it contaminant free. Steps to Install the replacement filter without any extra tools: Locate the filter below the refrigerator. Slowly turn the cartridge a 1/4 of a turn counter-clockwise and remove. Remove the knob from the former filter. Locate the filter below the refrigerator. Slowly turn the cartridge a 1/4 of a turn counter-clockwise and remove. Remove the knob from the former filter. Remove all packaging and the protective cap from the new filter. Remove all packaging and the protective cap from the new filter. Slide the knob from the former filter on to the new filter. Insert the new filter into the refrigerator and turn clockwise until fully seated. Slide the knob from the former filter on to the new filter. Insert the new filter into the refrigerator and turn clockwise until fully seated. Run water from the dispenser for 5 minutes (approximately 3 gallons) to clear the system and prevent air from entering the system. Run water from the dispenser for 5 minutes (approximately 3 gallons) to clear the system and prevent air from entering the system. Locate the included Water Filter Replacement Calendar and follow the instructions on the label.. Locate the included Water Filter Replacement Calendar and follow the instructions on the label.. Check the new filter installation for any possible leaks. If a leak is detected, uninstall and then reinstall the filter as instructed above. Check the new filter installation for any possible leaks. If a leak is detected, uninstall and then reinstall the filter as instructed above.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zpgIm3dHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aqua Fresh","source_asin":"B08Z8L67MB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-160304","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z8L67MB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z8L67MB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
