window.products.push({"id":160600,"name":"NC DC4700019A Dryer Heating Element, Thermal Fuse DC9600887 and DC4700016A, Thermostat DC4700018A, Dryer Thermistor DC3200007A, Replace Samsung Dryer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vNSxMTSXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Just buy the dryer heating element for samsung instead of dryer, which is very cost-effective. Fix common symptoms: Not enough heat or no heat Take too long to dry clothes Shut off too early Timer is not in advance Etc.  Advantages of DC47-00019A Samsung dryer heating element:Less heat lossMore power savingDurable  DC32-00007A Dryer Thermistor 1: DC32-00007A Dryer thermistor attaches to the blower housing, which helps to regulate and monitor the temperature in the dryer. 2: Replacement for numbers: AP4201716, AP6008688, PS4204984, PS11741828, WP35001191, 2068429. DC47-00018A High Limit Thermostat 1: If your dryer does not adjust the heat properly, you need to replace the high limit thermostat. 2: The upper limit of the thermostat is 260 ℉, the lower limit is 210 ℉, and the working range is 50 ℉. 3: Replacement for numbers: 35001092, 503497, AP4201898, AP6008682, PS4205217, PS2038383. DC47-00016A Thermal Fuse 1: When the clothes dryer is overheated, disconnect the power of dryer by way of thermal fuse. If thermal fuse blowns out that need to be replaced. 2: Replacement for numbers: AP4201899, PS2038533, 35001087. DC96-00887A Bracket Thermostat 1: When the dryer is overheated, the bracket thermostat starts to work and turns off the heating element. 2: Replacement for numbers: DC96-00887A, DC96-00887C, 2074129, WP35001193, AP4207819, AP5966894, PS11741829, PS2038484. Warm Tips 1: Disconnect power and make sure your dryer vents are clean before installing the repair. 2: Watch YouTube videos to make installation easier. Package Included: 1 x DC47-00019A Dryer Heating Element 1 x DC32-00007A Dryer Thermistor 1 x DC47-00018A High Limit Thermostat 1 x DC47-00016A Dryer Thermal Fuse 1 x DC96-00887A Thermal Fuse","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vNSxMTSXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"USonline911","source_asin":"B097DYGXXZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-160600","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097DYGXXZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B097DYGXXZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
