window.products.push({"id":160799,"name":"Nessus Reusable Vertuo Capsule Kit, [ALSeal EZ FIT] for Reusable Nespresso Pods with 100 Pcs Aluminum Foil Seal Lids, Holder, Brush, for Refilling Nes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iMyIA7WzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Complete Kit: The Nessus reusable vertuo capsule kit includes a refillable capsule holder, 100 PCS food-grade aluminum Nespresso foil seals, and a cleaning brush. With this kit, you can easily refill and reuse your vertuo pods, saving money and reducing waste. Perfect Size & Adhesion: Say goodbye to foil waste, weak coffee, and machine damage caused by ill-fitting seals. Our larger foil lids easily position reusable vertuo pods without covering the barcode. Plus, they feature food-grade adhesion that keeps your pods airtight and well-sealed, so you can pre-fill them and enjoy fresh coffee anytime. Sturdy & Clean: Don't settle for flimsy foil seals that tear and leave a mess. Our premium aluminum foil lids for Nespresso pods are extra thick, sturdy, and made with a unique process on the surface to prevent tearing. It allows you to create capsules without touching the adhesive areas, keeping your hands clean throughout the process. Easy to Refill: Refilling your vertuo reusable pods with the NESSUS refillable pods kit is simple and hassle-free. Just put the empty capsule into the holder, add your favorite coffee powder, and use the NESSUS foils to align on the edge of the capsule. Then, press the top cover of the holder to get a new capsule. Effective Solution: Our solution is tailored to extend the life of your Nespresso Vertuoline pods while reducing your environmental footprint. By reusing your Vertuoline pods instead of discarding them after one use, you can enjoy your favorite coffee blend and help protect our planet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iMyIA7WzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NESSUS","source_asin":"B0BZDDF2V4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-160799","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZDDF2V4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZDDF2V4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
