window.products.push({"id":160837,"name":"3 Layer Auto Scrolling Egg Container for Refrigerator, ULENDIS Stackable Clear Egg Tray Holder for Refrigerator with Lid, Large Capacity Egg Storage O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i83yvSucL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Innovative design egg holder to improve kitchen style Did you meet these problems in the kitchen before ? --Hard to take eggs out from traditional egg box? --Egg broken when storing? ULENDIS Egg Holder will help you to figure it out ! ✔Why Choice Our Egg Container for Refrigerator? 1.High Quality: It is made of food-grade PP material. The surface is very smooth and shiny, with good stability, good abrasion resistance and high hardness. 2.Three Layer Large Capacity: Each layer egg holder can hold up to 18 eggs. Three-layer can hold up to 54 eggs totally. 3. Ventilation Opening: The side of the box is designed with a vent window, and the vent allows the eggs to breathe freely and keeps fresh longer. At the same time, it can also be used as a handle, which is easy to carry. 4. Easy to clean: Use warm water to wash it directly or wipe with a rag. 5. Suitable for Various Egg Shapes: The egg tray is not only limited to putting eggs, but also it can be put in various egg shapes such as duck eggs and preserved eggs, and it is multi-purpose. ✔Convenient and Practical: Each layer is fixed by a card slot, which makes the egg box stable and reliable, neat and beautiful, convenient and practical. Removable Card slot design allows you to add or remove layers according to your refrigerator space and daily needs,which is the best choice for households storage. ✔Variety of Occasions: The egg storage is very suitable to be placed in refrigerators, cabinets, cold rooms, dining tables and other places. Perfect sealing and pressure resistance, suitable for outdoor camping, picnic activities and outdoor travel. ✔Specifications of Egg Organizer: Package Included: 3 x Egg Container for Refrigerator Size: 12in x 9.25in x 8.7in Material: Food-grade PP Material Color: Clear Improve your kitchen style now !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i83yvSucL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ULENDIS","source_asin":"B09Z7Z8TNW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-160837","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z7Z8TNW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z7Z8TNW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
